        },
        {
          "text": "Ni munyumve, yemwe ababa ku kiyaga; namwe mahanga ya kure, tega amatwi. Uhoraho yampamagaye ntaravuka; nkiri mu nda ya mama yamvuze izina: ",
          "type": "text",
