            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.6.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kor 6:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uku ni k’Uhoraho agize, ati Mu gihe co kwemererwamwo ndakwishuye, no ku musi wo gukirizwako ndagutabaye; kandi nzogukiza, ngushireho ube isezerano ry’abantu, kugira ng’ usibure igihugu, utume basubizwa mw ishamvu yabo yabaye imisaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ ubgire imbohe, uti Ni musohoke; n’ abari mu mwiza, uti Ni museruke ahabona. Bazogenda barisha umwagambo ku mayira, kand’ ahār’ uruharabuga hejuru ku misozi hazobabera ivyanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntibazokwicwa n’inzara canke n’inyota, kand’ indugumba ntizobahundagaza cank’ izuba: kuk’ uwabagiriye ikigongwe azobaja imbere, akabashikana no ku masōko y’amazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.40.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 40:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imisozi yanje yose nzoyihindura inzira, n’amarango yanje nzoyashira hejuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.107.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 107:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ehe bamwe bazova kure: eh’ abandi bazova i burārūko n’i burengerazuba, kand’ abandi bazova mu gihugu c’i Sinimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:13"
          },
          "items": [
