              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.14.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Guh 14:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.60.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 60:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.43.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 43:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unamura amaso urābe impande zose: ba bandi bose barakoranye, bariko baraza kuri wewe. Ndahiye ukubaho kwanje, ni k’Uhoraho agize, uzobīsakara nk’uwambaye utugenegene, uzobakenyera use n’umugeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.10.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 10:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukw amatongo yawe n’ imisaka yawe n’igihugu cawe cāgeshejwe, n’ukuri noneho hazokwagira abazohaba, kand’ abāri baragutsontsomeye bazoba kure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.54.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 54:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abana wari wānyazwe bazovugira mu matwi yawe, bat’ Aha hantu haratwagiye: segenya turonke aho tuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ uzokwibaza mu mutima, uti Mbeg’ aba nabavyariwe na nde? Ko nari naranyazwe abana banje, nkaba nd’ imbura n’igicibga n’inyererezi! Ko nari nsigaye nd’ inyakamwe, aba bo bamye hehe?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
