            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ abami bazokubera ba se babakurerera, n’abamikazi babo bazokubera ba nyina babakwonkereza; bazokwikubita imbere bubamye hasi, barigate umukungugu wo ku birenge vyawe; nawe uzomenya ko nd’ Uhoraho, kand’ abanyiteze ntibazomāramāra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbeg’ abahizi bonyagwa iminyago, cank’ abagororotsi bajanywekw inyagano borokorwa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:25"
          },
          "items": [
